Package: mados-desktop
Version: 0.1.3
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Madelyn <madelyn@madoslinux.org>
Depends: plasma-desktop,
 plasma-workspace,
 sddm,
 dolphin,
 konsole,
 kate,
 discover,
 network-manager,
 network-manager-gnome,
 pipewire,
 pipewire-pulse,
 wireplumber,
 mados-core,
 mados-ui,
 mados-settings,
 mados-update,
 mados-welcome
Description: MadOS Desktop Environment
 Installs the complete MadOS desktop experience.
 Also ships the MadOS Sakura theming payload in /usr/share/mados
 (asset tree, neofetch cat, system first-login runner) and an
 autostart entry so every new user account, local or domain,
 receives the full Sakura setup at first login.
